---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | FindPIAttorney.com"
  description="Read the Terms of Service for FindPIAttorney.com - your rights, responsibilities, and limitations when using our personal injury attorney directory."
  canonical="https://www.findpiattorney.com/terms-of-service"
>
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="bg-brand-900 text-white py-14">
      <div class="page-container text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4 border border-white/20">
          Legal Document
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-brand-200 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm">
          Please read these terms carefully before using FindPIAttorney.com. By accessing our site, you agree to be bound by these terms.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-brand-300">Last Updated: August 17, 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Effective: August 17, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-container section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

        <!-- Quick Summary -->
        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-900 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Important Notice</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-amber-800">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-amber-600 mt-0.5 font-bold">!</span> This website is an informational directory - not a law firm, referral service, or legal counsel.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-amber-600 mt-0.5 font-bold">!</span> Nothing on this site constitutes legal advice. Always consult a licensed attorney for your specific situation.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-amber-600 mt-0.5 font-bold">!</span> Verify all attorney credentials directly with your state bar before retaining any attorney.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

          <!-- Section 1 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p>
              By accessing or using the website located at <strong>https://www.findpiattorney.com</strong> ("the Site"), operated by FindPIAttorney.com ("we," "us," or "our"), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"), as well as our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-brand-700 underline font-medium">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/advertising-disclosure" class="text-brand-700 underline font-medium">Advertising Disclosure</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              If you do not agree to these Terms, please discontinue use of the Site immediately. We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time, with changes taking effect upon posting. Your continued use of the Site after any modification constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 2 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Nature of Service</h2>
            <p>
              FindPIAttorney.com is an independent, online informational directory that compiles publicly available information about personal injury attorneys licensed in the United States. Our current coverage includes Florida and New Jersey, with expansion to additional states ongoing.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">Specifically, FindPIAttorney.com is:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 font-bold">✓</span> An informational resource and public attorney index</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 font-bold">✓</span> A directory compiled from public bar association records</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 font-bold">✓</span> A free tool to help individuals locate licensed attorneys in their area</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4">FindPIAttorney.com is <strong>not</strong>:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold">✗</span> A law firm or legal practice of any kind</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold">✗</span> An attorney referral service as defined under applicable state bar rules</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold">✗</span> A provider of legal advice, legal opinions, or legal representation</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold">✗</span> An endorser or certifier of any attorney listed on this Site</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 3 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. No Legal Advice</h2>
            <p>
              <strong>Nothing on this website constitutes legal advice, legal counsel, or the establishment of an attorney-client relationship.</strong> All content, including attorney profiles, articles, guides, and FAQs, is provided for general informational purposes only.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              Laws vary by jurisdiction and change frequently. Information on this Site may not reflect the most current legal developments. You should always consult with a qualified, licensed attorney before making any legal decisions or taking any action based on information you find here.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 4 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Accuracy of Attorney Information</h2>
            <p>
              Attorney listings on this Site are compiled from publicly available records maintained by state bar associations. While we make reasonable efforts to ensure accuracy, we make <strong>no warranties or representations</strong> - express or implied - regarding the completeness, timeliness, accuracy, or fitness for a particular purpose of any information displayed.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">Attorney information may become outdated due to changes in:</p>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside text-sm">
              <li>Bar licensure status (suspension, reinstatement, disbarment)</li>
              <li>Firm affiliation, address, or contact details</li>
              <li>Practice areas or specializations</li>
              <li>Disciplinary actions or sanctions</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">
              <strong>You are solely responsible for independently verifying an attorney's current credentials, licensure status, and fitness for your case</strong> directly with the applicable state bar association before initiating contact, engaging services, or making any legal decisions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 5 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
            <p>
              All content on this Site - including but not limited to text, graphics, design, layout, code, logos, and compiled data - is the property of FindPIAttorney.com or its licensors and is protected by applicable copyright, trademark, and intellectual property laws.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              You may view, print, and use the content of this Site for personal, non-commercial purposes only. You may not reproduce, republish, distribute, scrape, copy, modify, create derivative works from, or commercially exploit any content without our express prior written consent.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 6 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
            <p>You agree not to:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold">✗</span> Use the Site for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any regulations</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold">✗</span> Scrape, data-mine, or systematically extract attorney data for commercial use</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold">✗</span> Introduce viruses, malware, or any harmful code to the Site</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold">✗</span> Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any portion of the Site or its servers</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 font-bold">✗</span> Misrepresent your identity or impersonate any person or entity</li>
