            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside text-sm">
              <li>Reliance on attorney information displayed on this Site</li>
              <li>Any outcome resulting from contacting or retaining any attorney listed herein</li>
              <li>Errors, omissions, or inaccuracies in attorney profiles</li>
              <li>Unauthorized access to or alteration of your data</li>
              <li>Any other matter relating to this Site</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 10 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">10. Indemnification</h2>
            <p>
              You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless FindPIAttorney.com, its owners, operators, employees, agents, and affiliates from and against any and all claims, liabilities, damages, losses, costs, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees) arising out of or in connection with: (a) your use of the Site; (b) your violation of these Terms; or (c) your violation of any third-party rights.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 11 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">11. Governing Law & Dispute Resolution</h2>
            <p>
              These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Florida, without regard to its conflict of law principles. Any dispute arising under or relating to these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the state and federal courts located in the State of Florida.
