            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 14 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">14. Contact</h2>
            <p>For questions or concerns regarding these Terms, please contact us:</p>
            <div class="mt-4 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 text-sm space-y-2">
